values
('tenfold-compact-0-au','The Tenfold Compact','event','The settlement at 0 A.U. that establishes the decentralized Tenfold order.','ratified','public'),('harl-road-death-396','Harl’s road death','event','Harl dies after taking nine travelers onto the mountain route; later accounts simplify a defensible choice into competing stories.','governing','spoiler'),('lower-field-396','Lower Field','event','Major Book One crowd conflict whose causal beginning cannot be reduced to Wren’s first identifiable bolt.','governing','spoiler'),('gate-crisis-396','The Gate crisis','event','Fifth-morning Gate crush; the Gate opens inward and casualty/missing counts diverge.','governing','spoiler'),('ivet-death-396','Ivet’s death','event','Ivet is fatally crushed against inner stone after helping clear a child and later dies.','governing','spoiler'),('wren-divided-report-396','Wren’s divided report','event','Wren separates observations, source keys and future-use risk rather than producing one neutral final account.','governing','spoiler'),('tomas-blank-page-396','Tomas ends the test','event','Tomas publicly refuses to enter a judgment on Sela and surrenders the Ledger key.','governing','spoiler'),('sela-departure-east-396','Sela leaves east','event','Sela leaves the Light Heights eastward with Harl’s knife while her Ledger page remains blank.','governing','spoiler')
